# The bar's builds, a sha256 each: the release workflow builds component/bar/ at the
# tag in the pinned Debian 12 image the pad builds in, and refuses to
# publish a binary whose sha256 is not the line here; `spark-shell on
# desktop` installs only the file that has it. CI's bar job checks the line
# too: the first build of a new one prints the sha256 to pin.
BAR_SHA256_X86_64_LINUX_GNU=bf62df9bf524ffe1f3e49367557c7c1f72abc8064db2696a6b48b11003969882
